# Tests Required

## Policy

No feature or bugfix merges without tests in the same change.

| Change type | Required tests |
|-------------|----------------|
| Schema / RLS | `supabase/tests/*.sql` |
| Package logic | Vitest `*.test.ts` |
| UI feature | Vitest + Testing Library; Playwright for journeys |
| Bugfix | Regression test named `regression_*` |
| Edge Function + SPA client | Vitest for client wrapper; RLS if migration adds RPC |

## Commands

- `pnpm test` — Vitest
- `pnpm test:rls` — Supabase RLS suite
- `pnpm test:e2e` — Playwright

Use skill: `.cursor/skills/edunudg-write-tests/SKILL.md`

Before finish: `.cursor/skills/edunudg-sync-artifacts/SKILL.md` (specs, docs, tests, skills, agents).

## Locators

- **Playwright**: `getByRole({ name })` is substring match — use `{ exact: true }` for shared prefixes (`Log in` vs `Log in with Google`; `Email` vs `Login email (optional)`). Center `/app/leads` list titles use parent name (`leadDisplayName`), not `child_name`.
- **Testing Library**: do **not** pass `exact: true` (not on `ByRoleOptions`; breaks typecheck). Use `exactAccessibleName("…")` from `@/test/exactAccessibleName` (anchored `/^…$/`).
- See `openspec/specs/staff-login/spec.md`.

## Platform homepage regressions

Bugfixes or changes to `isLegacyPlatformHomepageSeed`, brand/center landing merges, or homepage defaults MUST keep `regression_homepageLegacySeedKeepsBrandAssets` and `regression_tenantMarketingContentPreservesBrandAssets` green and follow rule `marketing-homepage-media`. Platform `/login` MUST keep `regression_login_renders_platform_nav_and_footer` and `regression_platform_login_renders_marketing_nav_and_footer` green (same Site nav + enterprise footer as `/`). Brand `/login` MUST keep `regression_brand_login_renders_public_nav_and_footer` green (same public nav + footer as that brand `/`). Pricing feature ticks MUST keep `regression_pricing_feature_checkmarks_use_css_unicode_escape` green (CSS `content` uses `\2713`, not a raw `✓`). Brand `/app/students` MUST keep `regression_brand_students_page_matches_centers_chrome`, `regression_brand_students_search_by_name_franchise_city`, `regression_brand_student_card_shows_contact_and_levels`, and `regression_brand_students_exports_full_roster_csv` green. Public brand/franchise nav logos MUST keep `regression_public_nav_logo_matches_franchise_size_without_border` green. Center `/app/students` **Copy Profile URL** MUST keep `regression_center_student_copies_learn_login_url_without_password` green. Brand `/app/centers` **Export Franchise** MUST keep `regression_brand_centers_exports_full_franchise_csv` green. Center `/app/students` **Save address** MUST keep `regression_save_address_shows_saved_status` green. Center `/app/inventory` and `/app/merchandise` Shop MUST keep `regression_center_inventory_shows_catalog_curriculum` and `regression_center_merchandise_shop_shows_catalog_curriculum` green. Inventory list cards MUST keep `regression_center_inventory_list_omits_detail_duplicates` green. Staff lead lists MUST keep `regression_lead_list_select_includes_csv_aligned_columns` green after `090_lead_csv_aligned_fields.sql`. Center `/app` staff chrome MUST keep `regression_center_shell_lockup_shows_brand_then_franchise_name` green (brand name + franchise display-name tagline next to the Site logo). Spark Academy Features Last month overlay MUST keep `regression_spark_features_omits_view_all_float_action` green (no **View all →**). Spark Academy **Courses designed for success** MUST keep `regression_spark_view_all_courses_only_when_overflow` and `regression_spark_view_all_courses_hidden_when_catalog_fits` green (**View all courses** only when the catalog overflows one wrapping row). Spark Academy `/about` MUST keep `regression_spark_about_page_uses_homepage_section_blocks`, `regression_spark_about_hero_omits_homepage_badges`, and `regression_spark_about_features_omits_float_badges` green (Hero / Features / Journey / Mentors; no Mastermind-only About chrome; homepage badges stay on `/`).

